    20	- `GIT_AUTHOR_NAME`, `GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL`
    21	- fallback anonymous ARC Bench identity
    22	
    23	## Rewind Safety
    24	
    25	`reset`, `restore-worktree`, and `clean-untracked` are destructive. Use them only for explicit pause/rewind/resume flows or direct user instruction.
